# ── Data & outputs (code-only repository) ─────────────────────────────────────
# Everything here is either too large for GitHub or fully regenerable by
# re-running the notebooks against Google Earth Engine.

# Rasters -- CLMS IMD ~229 MB each, predicted maps 157-203 MB, GHSL 42-51 MB.
# All exceed GitHub's 100 MB hard limit.
*.tif
*.tiff
*.tif.aux.xml
*.ovr

# Trained models (RF ~21 MB) -- regenerable, and joblib is version-fragile
*.joblib
*.pkl
*.h5

# Sample points, metrics tables, figures
*.gpkg
*.gpkg-shm
*.gpkg-wal
*.shp
*.shx
*.dbf
*.prj
*.cpg
*.qmd
*.csv
*.png
*.jpg
*.pdf

# Output directories
outputs_v2/
outputs_S2/
outputs_sampling/
outputs_transfer_v2/
samples_IMD/
samples_S2/

# Per-composite-method runs (samples_S2_stack/, outputs_S2_percentile/, ...)
samples_S2_*/
outputs_S2_*/

# data/ holds large rasters and the photo-interpreted CSVs -- not committed.
# Written as data/* rather than data/ so the negations below can apply: git
# does not descend into an excluded DIRECTORY, so a bare `data/` would make
# `!data/FACTS.md` unreachable.
data/*
# ── The fact base IS version-controlled ──────────────────────────────────────
# These four are the project's written record: the settled findings, the
# experiment map, the figure inventory, and the figure gap list. They are
# prose, small, and the thing most worth having history for.
!data/FACTS.md
!data/EXPERIMENT_MAP.md
!data/FIGURES.md
!data/FIGURE_GAPS.md

# ── Report figures ARE version-controlled ────────────────────────────────────
# The four figures under report/figs/ are built by code/make_report_figs.py
# from data/FACTS.md, so they are regenerable -- but the report cites them and
# they are ~330 KB in total, far below the limit that makes *.png a problem
# for the notebook outputs. Track them so the report is self-contained.
!report/figs/
!report/figs/*.png

aoi_milan/
docs/

# ── Secrets & credentials ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Earth Engine / Google Cloud service-account keys must never be committed.
*.json
!requirements*.json
.env
.env.*
credentials/
*-service-account*
.config/earthengine/

# ── Python ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.venv/
venv/
env/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.egg-info/
dist/
build/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# ── Jupyter ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.ipynb_checkpoints/
*-checkpoint.ipynb
profile_default/
ipython_config.py

# ── Logs ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
install_log.txt
*.log

# ── OS / editor ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~
report/*.docx
report/*.pdf
